    "quota": {
        "window_seconds": 60,
        "budget_points": 30,
        "read_cost": 1,
        "write_cost": 3,
        "_note": "Dossier section 8: throttling is a 60s sliding window with INTERNAL, unpublished thresholds (codes 117/207/4204, no Retry-After header). Conservative budget: one read = one Submit + its polls; submits are serialized per connection because the concurrent-report cap (207) is undocumented. Calibration is a live-pass item (ROLLOUT_NOTES)."
    },
