        "_comment": "Story 26.4 (dossier section 7): hierarchy Customer (manager, CustomerId) -> Advertiser Account (AccountId). The reporting entity (selection_level) is the ACCOUNT. discover_accounts = Customer Management v13 REST: User/Query (current user) then Accounts/Search paginated (predicate UserId Equals). Accounts carry the composite opaque id '<account_id>@<parent_customer_id>' so pulls resolve the mandatory CustomerId header without re-discovery (ids opaque to core, AD-2). Access check = SubmitGenerateReport of a 1-day tier-core campaign report on the selected account (submit success = access proven; the report itself is discarded). Core owns selection/access-check/trial/backfill; MICROSOFT_ADS_*_ID env vars are FORBIDDEN (doctrine 25.x).",
